Description: Implements LISA (LLM-Inferred Semantic Annotation) for
    differential-expression results. The package integrates enrichment results
    into biologically interpretable categories, compares compatible analyses,
    generates
    gene-level evidence products and builds portable HTML reports with linked
    source data and optional KEGG gene-set figures.
    Saved reports and their source files can be verified for integrity.
